# DentaFlow OS — Project Rules

Clinique Dentaire Témara Mall. Timezone for all clinic dates: **Africa/Casablanca**.

---

## 1. Project Overview

Three interfaces, one operations stack:

| Interface | Folder / entry | Role |
|---|---|---|
| Patient portal | `Temara_Patient_Portal/` | Public booking + lead capture |
| Doctor dashboard | `Temara_Dashboard/index.html` (`#doctor-shell`) | KPIs, charts, operational overview |
| Assistant command center | `Temara_Dashboard/assistant-shell.html` and/or `Temara_Assistant_Dashboard/` (`#assistant-shell` / `.assistant-app-root`) | Roster, waitlist, CRM, SMS, notes |

**Stack**

- Frontend: vanilla HTML / CSS / JS. No build system, no bundler, no ES modules.
- Backend: Vercel Node serverless functions under `Temara_Dashboard/api/` (and twin copies in assistant/patient apps). Browser calls **`/api/*` only**.
- Automation: n8n workflows triggered by webhooks. Frontend never calls n8n.
- Data: **Baserow** (PostgreSQL) for patients, bookings, waitlist, team notes. **Cal.com** is calendar SSOT. Google Sheets is **not** used for live KPIs.
- Auth: JWT (HS256) issued by `POST /api/auth`. Target storage is **httpOnly cookies**. Do not store tokens in `localStorage` / `sessionStorage`.
- Cache / locks: **Upstash Redis**. Cache is optional; locks on critical booking paths are not.

