## 2. Baserow Schema

Database: **Agency Operations** (`database/462074`). Prefer display names (`user_field_names = true`). Unwrap single-select objects `{ value, id }` to `.value` in Code nodes.

### 2.1 Bookings (table ID `1017856`)

Canonical URL pattern: `baserow.io/database/462074/table/1017856/…`  
Hardcode table ID **`1017856`** in n8n Baserow nodes (data pointer, not a secret). Do not use `$vars.BASEROW_TABLE_ID` in Dashboard Data Endpoint.

| # | Field name (exact) | Type | Values / notes |
|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | `Patient (Nom Complet)` | Text | Required for roster / CRM |
| 2 | `Email Contact` | Email / text | |
| 3 | `Téléphone (WhatsApp)` | Phone / text | Normalize to E.164 `+212…` in n8n |
| 4 | `Date & Heure du RDV` | Date/time | ISO `2026-08-15T10:15:00.000Z` or `DD/MM/YYYY HH:mm` |
| 5 | `Motif de Consultation` | Text / select | |
| 6 | `Observations Médicales` | Long text | |
| 7 | `Statut du RDV` | Single select | `Confirmé`, `Annulé`, `No-Show`, `En attente` |
| 8 | `Statut Facturation` | Single select | `Payé`, `Non payé` |
| 9 | `Montant (MAD)` | Number | Decimal; comma or space thousands OK |
| 10 | `Couverture Médicale` | Text / select | Insurance label shown in CRM |
| 11 | `N° d'Assurance` | Text | Policy number |
| 12 | `Cal Booking ID` | Text | Cal.com booking uid |
| 13 | `Nouveau Patient ?` | Single select | `Oui`, `Non` |
