## 3. n8n Webhook URL Patterns

Vercel stores full webhook URLs in `N8N_WEBHOOK_*` (or `N8N_WAITLIST_WEBHOOK`). Paths below are the n8n **webhook path** segment only. Never put hostnames in frontend JS.

| # | Vercel proxy | Env var | n8n path | Typical method |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | `/api/dashboard-data` | `N8N_WEBHOOK_DASHBOARD` | `dashboard-data` | GET |
| 2 | `/api/roster` | `N8N_WEBHOOK_ROSTER` | `assistant-data` | GET |
| 3 | `/api/n8n-proxy` | `N8N_WEBHOOK_DASHBOARD` or `N8N_WEBHOOK_ASSISTANT_PROXY` | `dashboard-data` / `assistant-data` | GET |
| 4 | `/api/update-status` | `N8N_WEBHOOK_UPDATE_STATUS` | `update-status` | POST |
| 5 | `/api/waitlist` | `N8N_WAITLIST_WEBHOOK` | `waitlist-add` (cascade also uses `dashboard-waitlist-add`) | POST |
| 6 | `/api/team-notes` GET | `N8N_WEBHOOK_GET_NOTES` | `get-notes` | GET |
| 7 | `/api/team-notes` POST | `N8N_WEBHOOK_POST_NOTE` | `post-note` | POST |
| 8 | `/api/fill-gap` | `N8N_WEBHOOK_FILL_GAP` | `fill-empty-slot` | POST |
| 9 | `/api/bulk-sms` | `N8N_WEBHOOK_BULK_SMS` | `bulk-sms` | POST |
| 10 | `/api/lead-capture` | `N8N_WEBHOOK_LEAD_CAPTURE` | `lead-capture` | POST |
| 11 | `/api/n8n-delay-alert` | `N8N_WEBHOOK_DELAY_ALERT` | delay-alert webhook (env URL) | POST |

Misc POST router `/api/proxy.js` maps `body.target` → extra env URLs (`bulk-confirm`, `bulk-cancel`, …). Same rules: env-only URLs, JWT, `x-agency-auth`.

n8n header to Vercel: **`x-agency-auth`**. Keys: `DASHBOARD_AUTH_KEY` and/or `N8N_AUTH_KEY` / `N8N_AGENCY_AUTH_KEY` (server-only).

